9901d1f36d35728.avif?t=1774377134\" width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/extras/2a7cbcb66869d5f3b1e25fa4c7deba09.poster.avif?t=1774377134\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/extras/2a7cbcb66869d5f3b1e25fa4c7deba09.webm?t=1774377134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/extras/2a7cbcb66869d5f3b1e25fa4c7deba09.mp4?t=1774377134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness supernatural mobility, strike with precision, and unleash abilities that reward timing, positioning, and clever decision-making. Your undead form is your greatest weapon, and more forms will emerge as your power grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/extras/6d28bf6c48eab09839fd8d0882e634c3.avif?t=1774377134\" width=1560 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/extras/6457582e1c22a6c38ef9614efb55c009.poster.avif?t=1774377134\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/extras/6457582e1c22a6c38ef9614efb55c009.webm?t=1774377134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/extras/6457582e1c22a6c38ef9614efb55c009.mp4?t=1774377134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadhaus Sonata features a tarot-based skill system where every card represents arcane power shaped by Malorum\u2019s forgotten history. Cards are earned through quests, battles, and exploration, and each one unlocks new abilities that can be mixed, matched, and upgraded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build for precision, raw power, mobility, tanking, or supernatural control. The tarot system gives you endless ways to refine your build and unleash devastating forces against the living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/extras/028b255b77b7658538f8a162410aec5b.avif?t=1774377134\" width=1560 height=160 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/extras/bef43ca6dfc0da09d770511979059941.poster.avif?t=1774377134\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/extras/bef43ca6dfc0da09d770511979059941.webm?t=1774377134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/extras/bef43ca6dfc0da09d770511979059941.mp4?t=1774377134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot in Deadhaus Sonata is earned through feats that track your actions, history, and performance, not random drops. Every item is shaped by what you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear, artifacts, legendary items, and tarot cards all tie into Malorum\u2019s supernatural and political history. Playing is crafting, and your past becomes a resource that influences your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/extras/34615a4fb57644e965e6dc9f1b7b0666.avif?t=1774377134\" width=1560 height=160 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/extras/9a0c6215a8310ab54561c519c1788422.poster.avif?t=1774377134\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/extras/9a0c6215a8310ab54561c519c1788422.webm?t=1774377134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/extras/9a0c6215a8310ab54561c519c1788422.mp4?t=1774377134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadhaus Sonata is a story-driven experience, featuring more than 15 hours of professionally voiced narration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by Denis Dyack, known for his work on Eternal Darkness: Sanity\u2019s Requiem, Blood Omen: Legacy of Kain, and Too Human, Deadhaus Sonata is a new dark fantasy world shaped by psychological depth, interconnected lore, and player-driven consequence. Every choice leaves a mark on your character and the world around you, with sentient gear, persistent events, and outcomes shaped by time, place, and action.</p>","developers":["Apocalypse Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1142050/7658c9309ca3de036ebb8ba5c52e37e1e719902e/header.jpg?t=1774377134","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Apocalypse Studios. 2018 - 2026 | Deadhaus Sonata \u00ae is a Registered Trademark of Apocalypse Studios Inc. | All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class